  "description": "FluentValidation cross-cutting decorator for the MPS CQRS IHandler pipeline. Wraps any IHandler<TIn, Result<TResult>> with an optional IValidator<TIn>; on validation failure returns a typed DomainError (ErrorType.Validation) with per-field Metadata — no control-flow exceptions. Kept as a separate package so FluentValidation is not forced on zero-dep consumers of Cayaqui.MPS.Abstractions. Proprietary — requires a commercial agreement with Cayaqui.",
